\begin{problem}
Below are state diagrams for two automata, $M_1$ and $M_2$.
Let $A = L(M_1)$ and $B = L(M_2)$ be the languages recognized by
these machines.

\begin{multicols}{2}
\begin{center}

\ifversionA
$M_1$
\begin{tikzpicture}[->,>=stealth',shorten >=1pt,auto,node distance=2.8cm,
                    semithick, scale = 0.7]
